{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_022_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:873145194f523a8a4d63f6663eaab3ec670109464dba4426657b27be11f4e175",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da22b2ae0c6cfcde4fb93a342ebc5a972db58c01bfbea5bcdc55efe3ced86b23",
      "text": "欸……给我的，情人节巧克力……吗？ ●●●●プロデューサー……谢谢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c1ae0a552e5998f11f6aa4b2e98d42615c8261c8dd64aa7c0e7402ca4d928c0",
      "text": "呵呵……收到制作人送的，巧克力……非常，开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3564fc444af85d911f375c2fdf49e6385c8fa10638e60807ffe8862e49d3896a",
      "text": "吃掉虽然，有点舍不得……不过，我会好好珍惜着吃的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d3d39610462a3cf118b903e6ff9f06604cc527f85c9fd1994e33b3274373286",
      "text": "呵呵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9da03ac68f2b82862c8cf8193c491af004121b643901e14bdf280ea9fc1e9fa",
      "text": "我也会在，白色情人节……回礼的。希望你，等着我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf748f253de57204dd81567793c2b90aa795fa692975c862755a93794c6d53a2",
      "text": "要送我，巧克力吗……？这样啊……今天是情人节，呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3318fbeecfd2d28a9d8de4e21b02b0f31744fc455c1adbe96f6f7a88ffd3c673",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー……我非常，开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e0db7714790f3ca72d8e5948ade6d35ebfbcc99c41da32dd9df8fab2b4760d",
      "text": "呵呵，好期待……品尝它。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d3718b25e7429fb05ae1b9c507963f02d9f8eb48ce258dd244cd926ba4f959",
      "text": "会是什么样的巧克力呢……真想快点，打开看看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:810e95985bedcd4dde0102695ea620186c445d940b3dac60d5248152f46413c4",
      "text": "是能让夏来先生露出笑容的巧克力",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59de09c7314b200f6bc0f8ff7f7e1ac50f47677c5255c8bd3b5a7a2760cc943b",
      "text": "是能让夏来先生充满活力的巧克力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc389e1fdf0f0744471bad0ceece00f316e6563d957baa709f4d3def18ea132",
      "text": "原来是这样……呵呵，真是很棒的巧克力呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3deca14ee5fcdbfa864f46f62dece47218e04bfddfb7630fb611717315d8cbfa",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。我会好好珍惜，享用的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_022_22:5_01_022_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b06cf50d7307fe0f0e26408d2329898700fd9e622b9935a77f4569273c16c18a",
      "text": "到了白色情人节，我也会……把能让制作人，充满活力、露出笑容的东西……回赠给你的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
